---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/layout/Header.astro';
import MobileMenu from '../components/layout/MobileMenu.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/sections/PageHero.astro';
import Divider from '../components/ui/Divider.astro';
import Contact from '../components/sections/Contact.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About · Winters Code"
  description="Preston Winters. 6th generation Bandon, Oregon. Solo software shop. I've owned small businesses. I know what it's like to drown in software you didn't choose."
>
  <Header />
  <MobileMenu />

  <PageHero
    eyebrow="About · Preston Winters"
    h1="I'm Preston Winters."
    sub="6th generation Bandon, Oregon. Solo software shop. I write the code, I ship the work, I answer the phone."
    sub2="I've owned small businesses. I know what it's like to drown in software you didn't choose."
  />

  <Divider label="01" />

  <!-- ─────────── Section 01 · The story (photo + prose) ─────────── -->
  <section class="ab-story" aria-labelledby="ab-story-h">
    <figure class="ab-photo">
      <picture>
        <source
          type="image/webp"
          srcset="
            /photo/preston-560.webp 560w,
            /photo/preston-840.webp 840w,
            /photo/preston-1120.webp 1120w
          "
          sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 380px, (min-width: 768px) 300px, 100vw"
        />
        <img
          src="/photo/preston-840.webp"
          alt="Preston Winters with his daughter at the Coquille River Lighthouse, Bandon, Oregon."
          width="840"
          height="796"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
          class="ab-photo-img"
        />
      </picture>
      <figcaption class="ab-photo-cap">
        Coquille River Lighthouse, Bandon. Where I'm from, where I work,
        where my kids are growing up.
      </figcaption>
    </figure>

    <div class="ab-prose">
      <h2 class="ab-story-h" id="ab-story-h">The short version.</h2>

      <p>
        Sixth generation Bandon. My dad's fifth gen, his dad before him,
        all the way back. I grew up here. My three daughters are growing
        up here. The plan is to stay.
      </p>

      <p>
        I'm self-taught on every stack I work in. Started with landscaping
        as a teenager and never stopped, I'm a licensed landscaping pro
        in Oregon. Picked up code somewhere along the way and didn't put
        it down. Now I build websites, apps, and AI tools for businesses
        on the Oregon coast. I do the design and the photography too. The landscaping work taught me how to show
        up on time, do the job right, and not make excuses. The same
        rules apply to software.
      </p>

      <p>
        I've been building my own software for a while.
        <a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/stainslayer-ai/id6757208835" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>StainSlayer</strong></a>
        is the one you can grab right now. A phone app that takes a
        picture of a stain and tells you how to get it out, live on the
        <a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/stainslayer-ai/id6757208835" target="_blank" rel="noopener">App Store</a>
        and
        <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.mycompany.stainslayerai" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Play</a>.
        A handful of others are in private beta: <strong>Baseline</strong>
        (political signal across a bunch of AI models at once),
        <strong>MyKonos</strong> (an AI companion with real memory),
        and <strong>ChopLight</strong> (motion based utility flashlight).
      </p>

      <p>
        That AI work shows up in your project whether you asked for
        it or not. I built my own memory engine that runs on top of
        Claude, and I use it on every build. So I'm not relearning
        your business every time we talk. The notes stick. The
        decisions stick. The same person who took your first call
        writes your code.
      </p>

      <p>
        Winters Code brought all of that home. I've owned small
        businesses. I know what it's like to drown in software you
        didn't choose. So I build the kind of tools I wish I'd had,
        for the kind of businesses I grew up around. Built to last,
        with somebody local on the other end of it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Divider label="02" />

  <!-- ─────────── Section 02 · How I work ─────────── -->
  <section class="ab-block" aria-labelledby="ab-how-h">
    <header class="ab-block-head">
      <h2 class="ab-block-h" id="ab-how-h">How I work.</h2>
      <p class="ab-block-sub">Plain rules. I keep them.</p>
    </header>

    <ul class="ab-how-list">
      <li>
        <strong>I show up in person when it matters.</strong>
        Small towns work on trust. Phone calls don't build it the same way.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>I write code that ships fast and doesn't break.</strong>
        Modern stack, no plugins to babysit, ~95 Lighthouse average across every site.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>I answer my texts within a few hours during business days.</strong>
        541-551-0731. Real human, real response time.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>I don't sub work out.</strong>
        You're hiring me, you get me. Same person every call.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>I'm here for the long run.</strong>
        Bandon's home. The shop isn't going anywhere. The person who built
        your site is the person who maintains it five years from now.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>The site fits your customer, not the other way around.</strong>
        Sometimes that means a long scrolling story. Sometimes that
        means a big phone number and a clear way to book. I figure
        out which one you need, then build that.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <Divider label="03" />

  <!-- ─────────── Section 03 · The four laws ─────────── -->
  <section class="ab-block ab-laws" aria-labelledby="ab-laws-h">
    <header class="ab-block-head">
      <h2 class="ab-block-h" id="ab-laws-h">What I believe.</h2>
      <p class="ab-block-sub">Four rules I won't bend.</p>
    </header>

    <ol class="ab-laws-list">
      <li>
        <span class="ab-law-num">01</span>
        <div class="ab-law-body">
          <h3 class="ab-law-h">Speed matters.</h3>
          <p>Days for sites, weeks for apps. Small businesses on the Oregon coast deserve tools that ship, not quarterly project plans.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="ab-law-num">02</span>
        <div class="ab-law-body">
          <h3 class="ab-law-h">Quality is non-negotiable.</h3>
          <p>Speed without quality is reputation death. ~95 Lighthouse average, security defaults, modern stack end to end.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="ab-law-num">03</span>
        <div class="ab-law-body">
          <h3 class="ab-law-h">I write the actual code.</h3>
          <p>Not WordPress, not Wix, not a builder. The code under your site is the code I wrote for your site. Loads faster, ranks better, stays secure.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="ab-law-num">04</span>
        <div class="ab-law-body">
          <h3 class="ab-law-h">Recurring relationships beat one-off projects.</h3>
          <p>The person who built it is the person who maintains it. Help is just a text away.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <Divider label="04" />

  <!-- ─────────── Section 04 · Bandon roots ─────────── -->
  <section class="ab-block ab-roots" aria-labelledby="ab-roots-h">
    <header class="ab-block-head">
      <h2 class="ab-block-h" id="ab-roots-h">Why Bandon.</h2>
    </header>

    <div class="ab-roots-body">
      <p>
        My family has been on the south Oregon coast for six generations.
        Bandon is where I grew up, where I'm raising my daughters,
        where I'll be in ten years. The coast is full of family
        businesses that deserve good tools, and the nearest agency is
        usually in Portland or further. That's the gap I'm filling.
      </p>
      <p>
        Bandon gets free in-person consults. I'll meet you at
        Warehouse Coffee or your shop. Coos and Curry counties get free
        30-min video. The phone number stays the same year after year.
        If you've ever called a national agency and gotten a ticket
        number instead of an answer, you know exactly what I'm the
        opposite of.
      </p>
      <p class="ab-roots-pull">
        <em>I'm down the road. I pick up the phone.</em>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Divider label="05" />

  <!-- ─────────── Section 05 · CTA ─────────── -->
  <section class="ab-cta" aria-label="Get in touch">
    <h2 class="ab-cta-h">Let's talk.</h2>
    <p class="ab-cta-sub">
      Free consult. No pitch deck. Honest take on what you have,
      a real number, and a quote on the spot if it's a fit.
    </p>
    <div class="ab-cta-actions">
      <a href="/contact" class="ab-cta-primary">Send a brief →</a>
      <a href="https://cal.com/preston-winters" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="ab-cta-secondary">
        Book on Cal →
      </a>
      <a href="sms:5415510731" class="ab-cta-secondary">Text me</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Divider label="06" />

  <Contact sectionNumber="06" />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* ─── Shared block scaffolding ─── */
  .ab-block {
    padding: 32px 4px 24px;
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .ab-block { padding: 48px 4px 32px; }
  }
  .ab-block-head { margin: 0 0 18px; }
  .ab-block-h {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 28px;
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: var(--color-ash-100);
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) { .ab-block-h { font-size: 36px; } }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) { .ab-block-h { font-size: 42px; } }
  .ab-block-sub {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--color-ash-400);
    margin: 0;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) { .ab-block-sub { font-size: 15px; } }

  /* ─── Section 01: photo + prose ─── */
  .ab-story {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 24px;
    padding: 24px 4px 16px;
    max-width: 960px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    align-items: start;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .ab-story { grid-template-columns: 260px 1fr; gap: 32px; padding: 40px 4px 24px; }
  }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .ab-story { grid-template-columns: 340px 1fr; gap: 48px; padding: 56px 4px 32px; }
  }

  .ab-photo {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 380px;
    justify-self: center;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) { .ab-photo { justify-self: start; } }
  .ab-photo-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: var(--radius-card, 10px);
    border: 1px solid var(--copper-hairline);
    display: block;
  }
  .ab-photo-cap {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-ash-500);
    margin: 10px 0 0;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) { .ab-photo-cap { font-size: 12px; } }

  .ab-prose { min-width: 0; }
  .ab-story-h {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 24px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: var(--color-ash-100);
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) { .ab-story-h { font-size: 28px; } }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) { .ab-story-h { font-size: 32px; } }

  .ab-prose p {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--color-ash-300);
    margin: 0 0 14px;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) { .ab-prose p { font-size: 16px; } }
  .ab-prose p strong { color: var(--color-ash-100); }
  .ab-prose p em {
    color: var(--color-copper-bright);
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .ab-prose p a {
    color: var(--color-ash-100);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: var(--color-copper);
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    transition: text-decoration-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .ab-prose p a:hover,
  .ab-prose p a:focus-visible {
    color: var(--color-copper-bright);
    text-decoration-color: var(--color-copper-bright);
    outline: none;
  }
  .ab-prose p a strong { color: inherit; }

  /* ─── Section 02: How I work ─── */
  .ab-how-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 14px;
  }
  .ab-how-list li {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-ash-300);
    padding: 0 0 14px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) { .ab-how-list li { font-size: 15px; } }
  .ab-how-list li:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
  .ab-how-list strong {
    display: block;
    color: var(--color-ash-100);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 4px;
  }

  /* ─── Section 03: Four laws ─── */
  .ab-laws-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 18px;
  }
  .ab-laws-list li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 56px 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 14px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--copper-hairline);
  }
  .ab-laws-list li:last-child {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--copper-hairline);
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .ab-laws-list li { grid-template-columns: 72px 1fr; gap: 20px; padding: 18px 0; }
  }

  .ab-law-num {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 36px;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--color-copper);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) { .ab-law-num { font-size: 48px; } }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) { .ab-law-num { font-size: 56px; } }

  .ab-law-body { min-width: 0; }
  .ab-law-h {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--color-ash-100);
    margin: 0 0 4px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) { .ab-law-h { font-size: 18px; } }
  .ab-law-body p {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--color-ash-400);
    margin: 0;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) { .ab-law-body p { font-size: 14px; } }

  /* ─── Section 04: Bandon roots ─── */
  .ab-roots-body p {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--color-ash-300);
    margin: 0 0 14px;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) { .ab-roots-body p { font-size: 16px; } }
  .ab-roots-pull {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 20px !important;
    line-height: 1.35 !important;
    color: var(--color-ash-100) !important;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--color-copper);
    padding-left: 16px;
    margin: 24px 0 0 !important;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .ab-roots-pull { font-size: 24px !important; padding-left: 20px; }
  }
  .ab-roots-pull em {
    color: var(--color-copper-bright);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* ─── Section 05: CTA ─── */
  .ab-cta {
    padding: 32px 4px 40px;
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) { .ab-cta { padding: 48px 4px 56px; } }
  .ab-cta-h {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 32px;
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: var(--color-ash-100);
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) { .ab-cta-h { font-size: 44px; } }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) { .ab-cta-h { font-size: 52px; } }
  .ab-cta-sub {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--color-ash-400);
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    max-width: 480px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) { .ab-cta-sub { font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 24px; } }
  .ab-cta-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .ab-cta-primary,
  .ab-cta-secondary {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 14px;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 10px 16px;
    transition: background-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .ab-cta-primary {
    background-color: var(--color-wc-green);
    color: var(--color-bg-deep);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .ab-cta-primary:hover,
  .ab-cta-primary:focus-visible {
    background-color: var(--color-wc-green-bright, var(--color-wc-green));
    outline: none;
  }
  .ab-cta-secondary {
    color: var(--color-ash-100);
    border: 1px solid var(--copper-hairline);
  }
  .ab-cta-secondary:hover,
  .ab-cta-secondary:focus-visible {
    border-color: var(--color-copper);
    outline: none;
  }
</style>
